        <obo:IAO_0000115>A pterin derivative that consists of pterin bearing amino, oxo and 1,2-dihydroxypropyl substituents at positions 2, 4 and 6 respectively. The parent of the class of biopterins; the &lt;small&gt;L&lt;/small&gt;-&lt;i&gt;erythro&lt;/i&gt; isomer occurs widely in nature.</obo:IAO_0000115>
