        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the class of  acetamides that is acetamide in which one of the hydrogens attached to the nitrogen atom is replaced by a 2-(5-methoxy-1&lt;em&gt;H&lt;/em&gt;-indol-3-yl)ethyl group. It is a hormone secreted by the pineal gland in humans.</obo:IAO_0000115>
